msgctxt "124"
msgid "*pant* *pant* What the hell are you...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "It's over. Turn yourself in now, and you'll get a light sentence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "No way... I can't get caught. I have to do this for her... I... I have to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "For her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Outta my way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "What happened to that criminal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Sorry. He got away. Is your cashier okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Just fine. We've still got all our money, and no one was injured."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Wait! We have to chase down that criminal! And I've got to call the police!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"I hate to be so bold, but could you go after that robber? We'd really "
"appreciate it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "(That robber had something else going on... What was he talking about...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "All right. Leave him to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Thank you, sir! I'll pay you for your service, so please! Go after him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "I'll go after the robber. You call the cops."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Yes, sir! I'll call them right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"(That guy's quick on his feet. There's no trace of him. I need to ask "
"around for witnesses.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "This is something the cops should handle. Call them right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "But... he'll get away..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Call the cops now, or he's long gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Yes, sir! I'll get on it right away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "(I guess the cops can take it from here.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Give it up. If you take this any further, you'll go to prison."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"I don't have a choice, man! Don't be a hero, I don't want to have to kill "
"you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Go After the Robber"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Don't Go After the Robber"
msgstr ""

